          "text": "SHÊN Ch'in-han 沈欽韓 (T. 文起, H. 小宛), July 5, 1775–1832, Jan. 22, scholar and poet, was a native of Mu-tu 木瀆, in the district of Wu-hsien (Soochow), Kiangsu. He was descended from a line of literati, but during his youth his family was poor.",
